      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "_yk4j0oHXD9hLxetRGjKb",
      "originalText": "Superkey\nany attribute set that\nuniquely identifies a tuple\n(may contain extra/redundant attributes)",
